Title: KAITHA
Credit: pilot sequence (golden test fixture)
Author: THE PANEL golden set
Draft date: 13 September 2026
Notes: English action lines; Malayalam dialogue in Malayalam script and Manglish. Slug spellings vary on purpose.

FADE IN:

EXT. VYPIN JETTY - NIGHT

Rain has just stopped. Sodium lamps buzz over the ferry ramp. Puddles hold the light like spilled turmeric.

A battered AMBULANCE idles by the ramp, wipers dead. A BRASS LOCKET shaped like a kaitha flower swings from its wing mirror.

ANJU (29, night-shift nurse, wet scrubs under a raincoat) stands by the driver's door counting the ferry lights across the backwater.

Her phone buzzes. She answers without looking.

ANJU
(low)
ചേട്ടാ, ഞാൻ ജെട്ടിയിൽ ഉണ്ട്. നീ എവിടെയാ?

RAVI (V.O.)
Ippo varaam. Onnu wait cheyy, Anju. Vandi block aayi.

ANJU
പത്തു മിനിറ്റ്. അതിൽ കൂടുതൽ ഇല്ല.

She hangs up. Across the water the ferry HORN sounds, long and low.

INT. AMBULANCE - CONTINUOUS

Inside, KURIAKOSE (60s, a court clerk's shirt, blood on the collar) lies strapped to the gurney. An oxygen line hisses. His eyes track Anju as she climbs in.

KURIAKOSE
(hoarse)
മോളേ... അവർ വരും. അവർ എപ്പോഴും വരും.

ANJU
ആരും വരില്ല. ഇന്ന് രാത്രി ഞാൻ ഉണ്ട്.

She checks the drip, then unhooks the BRASS LOCKET from the mirror and presses it into his palm.

ANJU (CONT'D)
ഇത് കയ്യിൽ പിടിച്ചോ. കൈ വിറയ്ക്കുമ്പോൾ ഇത് നോക്ക്.

He closes his fist around it. The oxygen line keeps hissing.

INT. KOCHI FLAT - NIGHT

A two-room flat above a tailoring shop. AMMACHI (68, Anju's mother) sits with the light off, a rosary moving through her fingers. The TV plays a mute cricket match.

Anju comes in fast, still in the raincoat.

AMMACHI
ഇത്ര രാത്രിയായിട്ട് എവിടെയായിരുന്നു?

ANJU
ഡ്യൂട്ടി കഴിഞ്ഞു. ഒരു രോഗിയെ വിടാൻ.

AMMACHI
കള്ളം പറയുമ്പോൾ നീ ചെരുപ്പ് ഊരാറില്ല. ഇപ്പോഴും ഊരിയിട്ടില്ല.

Anju looks down at her feet. Wet chappals on the red-oxide floor.

AMMACHI (CONT'D)
മകളേ, സത്യം ആയതിനാൽ അത് പറയണം. അല്ലാത്തപക്ഷം അത് നിന്നെ തിന്നും.

A long beat. Anju sits on the floor beside her mother's chair.

ANJU
(quiet)
താഴെ വണ്ടിയിൽ ഒരാൾ ഉണ്ട്. കോടതിയിൽ സാക്ഷി പറയാൻ പോകുന്ന ആൾ. അയാളെ കൊല്ലാൻ ആളുകൾ നോക്കുന്നു.

AMMACHI
നിന്റെ ചേട്ടൻ ഇതിൽ ഉണ്ടോ?

Anju does not answer. Ammachi's rosary stops.

ANJU
ഞാൻ അയാളെ ഇവിടെ ഒളിപ്പിക്കും. നേരം വെളുക്കുന്നത് വരെ. പിന്നെ ഫെറി.

Ammachi looks at the mute TV for a long moment. Then she gets up and switches it off.

AMMACHI
വാതിൽ കുറ്റിയിട്.

INT. APARTMENT, KOCHI - LATER

Kuriakose lies on Ammachi's cot behind a hung bedsheet. Anju sits at the window. RAVI (33, Anju's brother, a gold chain over a wet shirt) lets himself in with his own key. SHIBU (30s, Ravi's friend, always half a step behind him) waits at the door.

RAVI
Anju, ithu enthu paripadiya? Aa vandi road-il ninnu maattanam. Ippo thanne.

ANJU
Vandi evide venamenkilum nikkatte. Ningal randum ivide ninnu poyaal mathi.

SHIBU
Chechi, Kunjumon sir-inu ariyaam ee aal ivide undennu. Avante aalukal Broadway-il undu.

ANJU
Ariyatte.

Ravi pulls the bedsheet aside. Looks at Kuriakose. Looks at the locket in the old man's fist.

RAVI
(softly)
അച്ഛന്റെ ലോക്കറ്റ്.

ANJU
അച്ഛൻ കൊടുത്തതാ. ഇന്ന് അയാൾക്ക് വേണം.

RAVI
Nee ithu cheythal njan ninne rakshikkan pattilla, Anju. Enikku ariyilla ini enthu cheyyanam ennu.

ANJU
നീ ഒന്നും ചെയ്യണ്ട. ഇത്രയും കാലം ചെയ്തത് മതി.

Ravi stares at her. Then he laughs, once, without sound, and walks out. Shibu follows.

SHIBOO
(at the door, to Anju)
Chechi, sorry.

The door shuts. Kuriakose opens his eyes.

EXT. BROADWAY NIGHT MARKET - NIGHT

Fish, jasmine, diesel. A CROWD packs the lane between the tarpaulin stalls; a LOUDSPEAKER on a temple cart plays a film song at full distortion.

Anju threads the ambulance through it at walking pace, one hand on the horn. Kuriakose is hidden under a blanket in the back.

SERIES OF SHOTS - THE MARKET CLOSES IN

-- A FISH SELLER slaps the bonnet, shouting a price.
-- Two men in white shirts, KUNJUMON'S MEN, stand up from a tea stall as the ambulance passes.
-- A boy on a cycle keeps pace with the driver's window, grinning.
-- The BRASS LOCKET's chain glints in Kuriakose's fist under the blanket.

BACK TO SCENE

The men in white push through the crowd towards the ambulance.

MAN IN WHITE
Eda, vandi nirthada! Nirthaan paranjille!

ANJU
(to herself)
Illa. Innu illa.

She leans on the horn and drives into the crowd. The CROWD parts, screaming, and closes behind her like water.

INT./EXT. AMBULANCE / KOCHI FLAT - NIGHT

INTERCUT - ANJU DRIVING / AMMACHI AT THE FLAT

Anju drives one-handed, phone wedged at her ear. Ammachi stands at the flat window, the street below empty.

AMMACHI (V.O.)
അവർ ഇവിടെ വന്നു. രണ്ടു പേർ. ഞാൻ വാതിൽ തുറന്നില്ല.

ANJU
അമ്മച്ചി വാതിൽ തുറക്കണ്ട. ഞാൻ ഫെറി കടക്കുന്നു. Morning-il വിളിക്കാം.

AMMACHI
കുഞ്ഞേ... ചേട്ടൻ അവരുടെ കൂടെയാണോ?

Anju does not answer. She hangs up. Ahead, the checkpoint lights.

EXT. GOSHREE BRIDGE CHECKPOINT - NIGHT

A police barricade across the bridge approach. Two CONSTABLES with lathis. Behind them, SI KUNJUMON (50s, a laugh that never reaches his eyes) leans on a jeep, eating peanuts from a paper cone.

The ambulance rolls up. Anju lowers the window. Kunjumon walks over slowly.

SI KUNJUMON
എന്തൂട്ടാ ഇത്ര രാത്രി? ഏത് ആശുപത്രി?

ANJU
ജനറൽ ഹോസ്പിറ്റൽ. ഒരു ഹൃദയ രോഗി. ഫെറി വിടും മുമ്പ് എത്തണം.

He peers past her. His torch finds the wing mirror. Nothing hangs there.

SI KUNJUMON
Ambulance-il rogi undenkil pinnil oru nurse venam. Nee otthakkaano?

CONSTABLE
Gadi, pinnil aarum illa sir. Blanket maathram.

Kunjumon walks to the back door. Pulls it open. Torchlight on the blanket. Under it, Kuriakose does not move.

Then, from under the blanket, a hand comes out — and the BRASS LOCKET swings from its fist, catching the torch beam.

Kunjumon stops chewing.

SI KUNJUMON
(barely audible)
കൈത പൂവ്...

A long beat. The peanuts spill from the cone. Kunjumon steps back and shuts the door, gently.

SI KUNJUMON (CONT'D)
(to the constables)
വിട്. അതു ജനറലിലേക്ക് ആണ്.

CONSTABLE
Sir? We don't have orders for that.

Kunjumon does not answer. The barricade lifts. Anju drives through without looking at him. Behind her the constables stare at their SI.

EXT. VYPEEN JETTY - DAWN

Grey light on the water. The first ferry is loading. The ambulance is parked where it was at the start of the night, wipers still dead.

Anju helps Kuriakose down the ramp. He walks by himself now, the locket around his neck.

KURIAKOSE
ഇനി ഇത് നിനക്ക് വേണ്ടേ?

ANJU
അത് നിങ്ങളുടെ കൂടെ പോകട്ടെ. കോടതിയിൽ അത് കാണണം.

The ferry HORN sounds. He steps on. She does not wave.

INT. KOCHI FLAT. - DAWN

The flat, door still bolted. Ammachi at the window, rosary moving. Below, Anju's ambulance turns into the lane.

Ammachi begins to hum, then to sing, softly.

SONG: "KAITHA POOVIN MANAM" - MONTAGE TO MUSIC

♪ കൈത പൂവിൻ മണം വരുന്നു
♪ കായലിന്റെ കരയിലൂടെ
♪ Raavu theernnu, poovu veenu
♪ Nee varum vazhi nokki njan

-- Anju climbs the stairs, chappals in hand.
-- The bolt slides back.
-- Mother and daughter at the window, the ferry a dot on the water.

FADE OUT.
